863762537336_4086692268589983855_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b9Jy4yM6ujAQ7kNvwHHv4LC&_nc_oc=AdqOv32LV9oM1991o3rxV_8RhjKdH55GagX9OAF49BcA4lGGN6TCDiHrhX6Dcng779M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTSXZ8v9XL1tJGqcPQNRv4z91Lg4S9gfbaxdtqy9TgZUQ&oe=6B0B101C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Art Landscape.png", "id": "1609418293482417", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620666_1609418296815750_5619805930431487336_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oGdviv2cTtMQ7kNvwGfQATR&_nc_oc=AdrwK_gjHbm8SmBH_qydSN7BLPGT-Bmyf9A4F8asin93amCZIfiQv0dq3FTwVA-wUPQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSmqtmoJN5OHrSrf8GfNplAmnq9LzpthbHl5b26JEwoWA&oe=6B0B35BA"}, "display_name": "VEX MAGE", "keywords": ["FastPaced", "BulletHell", "Spellcasting", "Coop", "MovementBased"], "long_description": "Merge spells, cross dimensions, and dance through deadly arenas in this lightning-fast shooter. Claim your immortality on cross-platform leaderboards, alone or with up to two friends. Your name is eternal.\n\n# FEATURES\n\n* **Vexatious Combat:** Enemies strike from all sides - survive by mastering your movement and aggression.\n* **Combine The Elements:** Assign elemental runes to each hand and fuse them for devastating results.\n* **Fast-Fire Sessions:** Dive into a rapid-fire campaign of levels that explode with speed, chaos, and pure adrenaline. \n* **Co-op & Solo:** Fight alone or with up to two allies. The challenge adapts, so every run is a test of survival.\n* **Global Leaderboards:** Leave your mark and fight your way up the global leaderboards, where only the deadliest rise to the top.\n\n{849035310808875}", "short_description": "Merge spells, cross dimensions, and dance through deadly arenas in this lightning-fast shooter. Claim your immortality on cross-platform leaderboards, alone 